  "cert.dc": { en: "<strong>DC models:</strong> File E335803 also recognizes DC-rated variants (model codes with a DC suffix, many also in -U form) across the 20S, 22S, 27L, 30S and 34S series. Three series include DC-only grades beyond the AC coverage above — 22S: 911, 102, 112, 122 (910–1,200 V); 30S: 102, 751, 911 (750–1,000 V); and 54L, whose only recognized model is the DC-rated 54LK911. The full model list is in the UL Product iQ record for File E335803.", zh: "<strong>DC 型号：</strong>E335803 档案还认可 20S、22S、27L、30S 与 34S 系列的 DC 额定变体（型号带 DC 后缀，多数另有 -U 型）。其中三个系列含上表交流覆盖之外的 DC 专属档位——22S：911、102、112、122（910–1,200 V）；30S：102、751、911（750–1,000 V）；54L 在册的唯一型号即 DC 额定的 54LK911。完整型号清单见 UL Product iQ 中 E335803 号档案记录。" },
